# Generated by build.sh
manifest.json

*.log

# Local session-continuity tracking (not part of the project)
SESSION_LOG.md

# OpenROAD sidecar working state: the managed upstream checkout (~3 GB) and
# the host virtualenv the live gate runs in. Both are rebuildable from
# openroad/openroad.pin.
openroad/.openroad-src/
openroad/.venv/

# Demo / project artifacts under examples/<project>/. The export and the verify
# stage regenerate everything below; only the heavy and scratch files are
# ignored. The light deliverables are tracked on purpose (a fresh clone then
# opens the demo in chiplet-studio and carries the DRC results without a
# rebuild): the .chiplet + MANIFEST.md at the outputs/ root, the _interposer.gds
# and *.json sidecars under outputs/layout/, and the reports under
# outputs/reports/.
#
# Keep this block in lockstep with .dockerignore, and with the per-project
# .gitignore that `adk-new-project` scaffolds (same patterns, project-relative).
#
# outputs/ : the GDS layouts and their sidecars live under layout/; ignore only
#            the heavy layout/*_complete.gds, the intermediate .hyp, the DRC
#            working dir and the run logs. The DRC reports
#            (reports/*_assembly_drc.lyrdb, reports/*_cupillar_drc.json) and
#            MANIFEST.md stay tracked.
examples/**/outputs/layout/*_complete.gds
examples/**/outputs/*.hyp
examples/**/outputs/reports/assembly_drc/
examples/**/outputs/logs/
# kicad/ : KiCad's own scratch (caches, autosaves, lock files, local prefs).
examples/**/*-backups/
examples/**/fp-info-cache
examples/**/*.kicad_prl
examples/**/_autosave-*
examples/**/*.lck
